{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064233/block/singleImage/3269773/df/01M7M90JCMT95WPH7Y4YA88998.jpg?updatedAt=1794906179\"/><figcaption>44歲內地瘸漢涉大埔街頭行乞被捕。(大埔警區Facebook)</figcaption></figure><p>大埔分區軍裝巡邏小隊人員於今日 (17 日 ) 進行反罪惡巡邏期間，在大埔鄉事會街發現一名男子懷疑進行行乞活動。經觀察及搜證後，人員迅速採取行動，以涉嫌「乞取施捨」拘捕該名 44 歲內地男子。從警方圖片可見，被捕男子須以義肢輔助行走。 警方重申，街頭行乞屬違法行為。警方會繼續加強情報蒐集，並於區內行乞黑點及人流較多的街道保持高調巡邏，果斷執法，打擊非法行乞活動。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:31:39.809272+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:16:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T10:37:14.423138+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T09:24:59.399871+00:00","content_hash":"4cb03ebea08eee6a972eab57c392bad57d6fc53464598cd220245c8cd7dba858","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:31:39.809272+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}